    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">our goal to estimate the treatment effects of different medications for this disease based on the provided observational data.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">estimate the individual treatment effect of a medicine</hasEvidenceText>
