    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the concept of d-separation (Pearl, 1986), which denes a graphical criterion of separability between nodes analogous to the statis</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
