    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Rule 1. (Insertion/deletion of observations) P ( y | do ( x ) , z, w ) = P ( y | do ( x ) , w )</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
