    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">causal relationships between features and the class variable are robust across domains, we propose a novel Causal AutoEncoder (CAE) for learning robust causal representations</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
