    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A typical structure preserving intervention (Eberhardt and Scheines, 2007) changes either the parent-child functional relationship, or the distribution of</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
