    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">IHDP (Semi-Synthetic) : The IHDP dataset has gained popularity in the causal inference literature dealing with heterogenous treatment effects</hasEvidenceText>
