    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The estimator has the well-known double robustness property</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Doubly-Robust learner (DR-learner): A more ecient method than the T-learner can be the DR-learner. It builds on the T-learner and adds a version of the inverse probability weighting (IPW) scheme</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
